      "topic": "The Four Basic Animal Tissues",
      "narration": "Hello! Pinch the back of your hand gently. What do you feel?",
      "ask": {
        "question": "Pinch the back of your hand gently — what do you feel?",
        "expect": "Outer skin layer, firm tissue underneath, and a pinch sensation.",
        "hint": "Notice the thin sheet on top, the firmer tissue below, and the feeling sent to your brain."
      },
